+\subsection{Data-Processing Contract}
+The generated record is deliberately not the model input. EchoForge first emits scenario-group manifests and raw complex-IQ shard references; then detector-view CSVs summarize radar, acoustic, passive-RF, and fusion cues; then model-facing matrices drop audit identifiers through a denylist before calibration and scoring. The paper evidence files are generated after scoring, so figures and tables are downstream of auditable artifacts rather than hand-edited screenshots.
+
+\begin{figure*}[t]
+  \centering
+  \includegraphics[width=0.98\textwidth]{data_processing_flow.pdf}
+  \caption{Data-processing contract from scenario generation to paper evidence. Scenario groups and raw IQ references are generated first; detector-view summaries are then exported with audit fields visible for guard testing; model-facing matrices deny labels, split keys, group IDs, and generator state; train/CV selection and calibration run before the single blind-holdout score; finally, the evidence manifest drives the figures and tables.}
+  \label{fig:dataprocessing}
+\end{figure*}
+
+\begin{table*}[t]
+  \caption{Data-Processing Guardrails}
+  \label{tab:dataprocessing}
+  \centering
+  \small
+  \begin{tabular}{@{}p{0.20\textwidth}p{0.31\textwidth}p{0.38\textwidth}@{}}
+    \toprule
+    Stage & Output & Review concern addressed \\
+    \midrule
+    Scenario generation & group manifest, phase records, raw-IQ shard references & Proves group lock and phase expansion before splitting \\
+    Detector-view export & radar/acoustic/passive-RF/fusion summary CSVs & Shows the model sees detector products, not hidden generator state \\
+    Denylist application & model-facing matrices without labels, split keys, group IDs, or audit headers & Blocks leakage from identifiers and split metadata \\
+    Train/CV selection & candidate scores, calibrators, thresholds, selection lock & Prevents holdout tuning and records the comparator threshold source \\
+    Blind holdout scoring & score CSVs, confusion rows, PR/ROC traces, calibration bins & Keeps one score pass and supports recomputation of every table/figure \\
+    Paper evidence & JSON/CSV evidence bundle and generated figures & Makes the manuscript reproducible from artifacts \\
+    \bottomrule
+  \end{tabular}
+\end{table*}
